Subject: [PATCH 4/9] Fix 'No supported index is available' errors in ASEAN
 Macro Dashboard forecasts

- Convert Current Account series to an annual PeriodIndex (new helper
  make_forecastable_annual_series) before fitting SARIMAX; a plain integer
  year Index has no frequency, so statsmodels could not extend it and
  forecast() raised ValueError('No supported index is available.')
- Resample daily FX data to month-end before fitting SARIMA(1,1,1)(1,1,1,12);
  the seasonal period of 12 is only valid for monthly data, and ensures the
  DatetimeIndex can be extended for the 12-month forecast
- Flatten yfinance MultiIndex columns in get_market_data so Close is a Series
- Add 4 regression tests (TestNoSupportedIndexFix): reproduce the original
  failure, verify the fix, gap-filling behavior, and FX monthly resampling
